/*!
\page page_strpstrackpoint StRpsTrackPoint

\brief Reconstructed (x, y, z) hit position in a single Roman Pot detector station.

\section rpstrackpoint_overview Overview

StRpsTrackPoint is the local reconstructed hit position in one Roman Pot station.
It is built from clusters in the four silicon strip planes of the station and stores
the 3D position, PMT timing signals, a quality classification, and per-plane cluster indices.

**Detector**: Roman Pot System (RPS / pp2pp)  
**Stage**: Per-station hit reconstruction; input to StRpsTrack

\section rpstrackpoint_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StRpsTrackPoint
\endcode

Referenced by \c StRpsTrack::trackPoint(station).

\section rpstrackpoint_quality Quality Enum

| Enumerator | Meaning |
|------------|---------|
| \c rpsNormal | Standard quality |
| \c rpsGolden | All four planes contributed |
| \c rpsNotSet | Quality not assigned |

\section rpstrackpoint_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c int | \c mRpId | Roman Pot index (0–7) |
| \c int[4] | \c mClusterId | Cluster index in each plane (−1 = plane unused) |
| \c double[2] | \c mTime | PMT timing signals (ns); −1 if absent |
| \c StThreeVectorF | \c mPosition | Reconstructed (x, y, z) hit position (cm) |
| \c StRpsTrackPointQuality | \c mQuality | Quality classification |

\section rpstrackpoint_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c positionVec() | 3D position vector (cm) |
| \c x(), \c y(), \c z() | Individual coordinates (cm) |
| \c rpId() | Roman Pot index (0–7) |
| \c clusterId(planeId) | Cluster index for plane \c planeId |
| \c time(pmtId) | PMT timing signal (ns) |
| \c quality() | Reconstruction quality |
| \c planesUsed() | Number of contributing silicon planes |

\section rpstrackpoint_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StRpsTrackPoint* tp = track->trackPoint(0); // station 0
if (!tp) return;
double x  = tp->x();          // cm
double y  = tp->y();          // cm
double t0 = tp->time(0);      // PMT 0 timing (ns)
unsigned int nPl = tp->planesUsed();
\endcode

\see StRpsTrack, StRpsCluster, StRpsCollection
*/
